name 'csaif_pl_ai_01-rev-01'
title 'Check for Understanding: Revising Prompts'
description ''
question 'A student prompts an AI: Explain how volcanoes work. The response is too brief, and the student wants a more detailed explanation. Which updated prompt would you suggest they try next?'

wrong 'Explain volcanoes using more words'
right  'Explain in detail how volcanoes form and erupt, including magma, pressure, and types of eruptions'
wrong 'Write a paper about volcanoes'
wrong 'Give me lots of details about how volcanoes work'
allow_multiple_attempts true